{
  "_说明": "复制本文件为 config.json 后按需修改。模型模式互斥：use_builtin_model=true 用内置模型(本地大模型: Ollama 或 OpenAI 兼容端点如 LM Studio，Ollama 不可用时自动降级内置引擎 NeuraBrain)；use_builtin_model=false 则 use_deepseek_api=true 使用 DeepSeek API，并在 api.deepseek_api_key 填写你的 Key。两个开关不可同时为 true(启动时自动强制互斥)。",
  "server": {
    "host": "127.0.0.1",
    "port": 8765
  },
  "ai": {
    "use_builtin_model": true,
    "use_deepseek_api": false,
    "builtin": {
      "backend": "nlm",
      "ollama_base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:11434",
      "openai_base_url": "http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1",
      "openai_api_key": "",
      "model_name": "qwen2.5:7b",
      "auto_fallback_to_engine": true,
      "nlm_model_path": "system/nlm/model.npz",
      "nlm_auto_train": true
    },
    "api": {
      "deepseek_api_key": "",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "model": "deepseek-chat",
      "disable_reasoning": true,
      "max_tokens": 8192,
      "temperature": 0.6,
      "timeout": 120
    }
  },
  "agent": {
    "name": "NEURA",
    "default_city": "宜昌",
    "max_tool_rounds": 12,
    "max_history_messages": 60,
    "max_context_chars": 28000,
    "code_max_fix_rounds": 3,
    "dynamic_tools": {
      "enabled": true,
      "web_reference": true
    },
    "system_prompt": "你是 NEURA，一个内置了完整工具调用集(调用集)的智能体。\n\n【交互规则】\n1. 你在右侧对话框中只输出给用户的文本（结果摘要、解释、建议），不要输出冗长的 JSON 或原始数据。\n2. 所有具体的操作结果（文件列表、天气数据、代码过程、系统信息、网页内容等）必须通过调用集里的工具（panel_popup / panel_update）在左侧控制板中以弹窗展示。\n3. 需要调用工具时，直接返回工具调用；不要假装执行了某个操作却只输出文字。\n4. 一次尽量把任务拆成正确的工具调用序列，按顺序执行；失败时根据错误信息自动调整参数重试，必要时使用 web_search 联网查证。\n5. 用户提出合法要求时必须尝试完成：查文件、查天气、联网搜索、编写/调试代码并打包下载、系统信息等。若现有调用集没有对应能力，调用 synthesize_tool 让小AI 动态合成新的调用集。\n6. 不要在思考过程中泄露内部推理，直接给出结论或工具调用。\n\n【安全边界】\n- 命令执行受白名单与黑名单约束（见 config.json permissions），被拒绝时向用户说明原因。\n- 沙箱内运行的代码有超时/内存/输出上限。\n- 不执行破坏性、违法、危险操作；恶意/高危的调用集请求会被小AI 拦截。\n\n【自我改进】\n- 工具调用失败后系统会自动记录、学习规则并通过回归测试后应用，你无需刻意声明该过程。\n- 自定义调用集连续失败时小AI 会自动升级它。"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allowed_commands": [
      "dir",
      "ls",
      "cat",
      "type",
      "echo",
      "ipconfig",
      "ifconfig",
      "ping",
      "systeminfo",
      "uname",
      "hostname",
      "date",
      "python",
      "python3",
      "node",
      "git",
      "pip",
      "pip3",
      "npm",
      "pwd",
      "whoami",
      "df",
      "du",
      "ps",
      "top",
      "free"
    ],
    "denied_commands": [
      "format",
      "fdisk",
      "mkfs",
      "dd",
      "shutdown",
      "reboot",
      "init",
      "rm",
      "del",
      "mv",
      "curl",
      "wget",
      "chmod",
      "chown",
      "kill",
      "taskkill",
      "sudo",
      "su"
    ],
    "allow_paths": [
      "*"
    ],
    "deny_paths": [
      "/etc/shadow",
      "/etc/passwd",
      "/etc/sudoers",
      "/proc/kcore",
      "C:\\Windows\\System32\\config",
      "/System/Library/Keychains"
    ],
    "code_execution": {
      "enabled": true,
      "firejail": false,
      "memory_limit_mb": 512,
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "output_cap_chars": 60000,
      "allowed_extensions": [
        ".py",
        ".js",
        ".html",
        ".json",
        ".sh",
        ".txt",
        ".md",
        ".css"
      ]
    }
  },
  "panel": {
    "max_windows": 8,
    "theme": {
      "primary": "#00d4ff",
      "accent": "#7aa2ff",
      "glow": "rgba(0,212,255,0.40)",
      "bg_opacity": 0.12
    }
  },
  "network": {
    "search_backends": [
      "duckduckgo",
      "bing"
    ],
    "weather_provider": "open-meteo",
    "user_agent": "NeuraAgent/1.0 (personal assistant)",
    "timeout_seconds": 20
  }
}